  "_comment": "Encounter pools by node type. depthTier buckets the node's position along the map (0 = early, 1 = mid, 2 = late) so difficulty scales with progress. A fight node draws one encounter at random from the matching pool. Events: one is drawn at random per event node; a flashcard decides reward (right) vs penalty (wrong). Outcome types: gold, potion, relic, heal, maxHP, loseHP, loseGold, gear. Themes: every encounter names its own theme; a bg_<themeId> image in Assets.xcassets replaces the placeholder painting. style: forest/camp/graveyard/ruins/cave/crypt/mountain/swamp/lair. platform: grass/stone/snow/moss/ash/rock.",
